      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> (S1) is the android queen in <Picture 1>: short white bob hair, ornate silver crown set with blue gems, white armored dress with translucent fabric, blue crystal details, pale skin, calm regal expression.\n\nsummary:\nA cinematic medium shot of <Subject 1> standing in a dark teal-lit interior at night. She faces the camera and speaks one short, clear Mandarin line.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1>: retain the face, white bob hair, crown, white-and-silver armor, blue gem placement, body proportions and identity exactly.\n<Audio 1>: voice reference only; match its timbre and clear articulation, do not copy its words.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] 00:00.000-00:05.167. Cinematic medium shot, eye level, slow push-in. <Subject 1> stands in a dark teal-lit interior at night; subtle wind moves her hair and the translucent fabric, soft rim light behind her, faint reflections on the armor and blue gems. She looks into the camera, calm and regal. From 00:01.000 to 00:04.500 she says the complete sentence in a natural, clear young female voice, articulate every word, moderate pace, no robotic or synthetic effect; her voice timbre and delivery follow <Audio 1>. <Subject 1> (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] 你好，欢迎来到我的王国。</d> Precise lip sync, natural blinking and small head movement, stable identity, film grain, high detail.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet interior room tone with a very faint low wind; the voice is close, dry and clearly audible, no music, no reverb, no other sound sources.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
        608,
